---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_published: claimTokenAllocation(proof, amount, vestingSchedule)
    q_check_published --> q_check_supplied: resultsPublished == true
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: results not published
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_claimed: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_not_supplied: tokens not supplied
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: investorPosition[investor].hasSettled == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_check_vesting: MerkleProof.verify(proof, claimMerkleRoot, leaf(investor, amount, vestingSchedule))
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid Merkle proof
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vestingSchedule has time-locked portions
    q_check_vesting --> q_direct_transfer: no vesting required
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_to_vesting: deploy vesting contract clone
    q_transfer_to_vesting --> q_mark_settled: askToken.transfer(vestingContract, lockedAmount)
    q_direct_transfer --> q_mark_settled: askToken.transfer(investor, amount)
    q_mark_settled --> q_emit: investorPosition[investor].hasSettled = true, vestingAddress = vestingContract
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokenAllocationClaimed(investor, amount, vestingContract)
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_revert_not_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: each investor can claim exactly once (hasSettled is monotonic false->true)
        INV-002: total tokens distributed <= totalTokensAllocated
        INV-003: vesting contract receives correct locked token amount
        INV-004: Merkle proof ties investor address to exact allocation amount
    end note
